# Final Report Format

Every autonomous run must end with **exactly** this format:

```
Branch:
Summary:
Files changed:
Tests run:
Results:
Known issues:
Unimplemented requirements:
Uncommitted changes:
Suggested next run:
```

## Field Guidance

| Field | Content |
|-------|---------|
| Branch | Feature branch name worked on |
| Summary | 2–4 sentences on what was accomplished |
| Files changed | Key files added/modified (not every file if numerous) |
| Tests run | Commands executed, or "none — documentation only" |
| Results | Pass/fail counts or N/A |
| Known issues | Honest blockers or limitations |
| Unimplemented requirements | Acceptance items not met |
| Uncommitted changes | `git status --short` output or "none" |
| Suggested next run | Next run ID from `docs/runs/` |

Do not claim milestones complete unless acceptance checklists are satisfied.
